    "reviews": [
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJy86j48MJBDQRlG0DeQZDRdU/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kblduQkRiemROZFVOUU5YWkRVbk56U0ZGZlVGRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 個月前",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": {
          "text": "用 Eatigo 訂座，去到先被告知每人必須點一杯正價飲品。結果飲品選擇極少，夾硬點咗杯罐裝梳打，嚟到係原罐上嘅汽水，收 $48，去五星級酒店飲都唔使 $48 罐汽水啦？\n在場座位冇坐滿，但食物上得極慢，等咗約40鐘先有得食。小食份量細到只夠一人食，叫咗個咩芝士西蘭花，原本預一齊 share，點知細到根本分唔到。\n最嬲係特登揸車入嚟，山長水遠嚟到，附近無咩揀，結果逼住要食，焗住被掠水，永久黑名單！\n\nTotal Rip-off.\nBooked through Eatigo for 50% off, only to be told on arrival that EVERYONE is forced to order a regular-priced drink. Options were terrible, and a canned soda—served straight in the can—cost a whopping $48! Even 5-star hotels don't charge that much for a can of soda. Complete forced consumption.\nService was painfully slow; we waited over 40 mins for the food. To make matters worse, the portions for sides were tiny, barely enough for one person, let alone sharing.\nThe worst part is that I drove all the way to Science Park just for this, and since there weren't many other options around, we were forced to stay and eat. Using 50% off as bait just to fleece customers with $48 sodas and shrunken portions is incredibly dishonest. Never again.",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "用 Eatigo 訂座，去到先被告知每人必須點一杯正價飲品。結果飲品選擇極少，夾硬點咗杯罐裝梳打，嚟到係原罐上嘅汽水，收 $48，去五星級酒店飲都唔使 $48 罐汽水啦？\n在場座位冇坐滿，但食物上得極慢，等咗約40鐘先有得食。小食份量細到只夠一人食，叫咗個咩芝士西蘭花，原本預一齊 share，點知細到根本分唔到。\n最嬲係特登揸車入嚟，山長水遠嚟到，附近無咩揀，結果逼住要食，焗住被掠水，永久黑名單！\n\nTotal Rip-off.\nBooked through Eatigo for 50% off, only to be told on arrival that EVERYONE is forced to order a regular-priced drink. Options were terrible, and a canned soda—served straight in the can—cost a whopping $48! Even 5-star hotels don't charge that much for a can of soda. Complete forced consumption.\nService was painfully slow; we waited over 40 mins for the food. To make matters worse, the portions for sides were tiny, barely enough for one person, let alone sharing.\nThe worst part is that I drove all the way to Science Park just for this, and since there weren't many other options around, we were forced to stay and eat. Using 50% off as bait just to fleece customers with $48 sodas and shrunken portions is incredibly dishonest. Never again.",
